{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "John in Mexico", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Underwater Wonders", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Taking a Break > Baja", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Targeted Information", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "If you don't understand what a person says, you can ask them to repeat or to clarify what they mean.   <br/>You can also put an idea in different words to make sure you understand. <br/>This is called <span class=\"italic\">rephrasing</span>.<br/>Here are some expressions to ask for repetition, clarification or to rephrase an idea.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Repetition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Clarification\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Rephrasing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you say that again, please?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What exactly do you mean by that?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you mean you can photograph the desert?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you repeat that, please?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you explain what you mean?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Did you say you could go fishing, hiking or surfing?\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you clarify that, please?\\\"}\",\"\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Notice that you use modals (could, would) and Wh-questions (what, where, who, when, etc.) to ask for repetition and clarification.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "whale watching ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "activity where you go on a boat to see whales in the ocean", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We might go whale watching, or just enjoy the beaches.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about travel.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "horseback riding ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "activity where you ride on a horse", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You could go horseback riding this afternoon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "everything", "type": "name"}, {"content": "all things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(pronoun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Baja California has everything, from deserts to mountains to forests to beaches.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "area", "type": "name"}, {"content": "place; region", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Baja California is one of the most interesting areas in the world. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to photograph ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to take pictures (photographs)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You could photograph the desert, the fish and the plants. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fish", "type": "name"}, {"content": "animals that live in water, with gills and fins", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is fun to see many tropical fish. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "endless ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "with no limit or end", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The possibilities are endless!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online to find out where you can go whale watching.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out what kind of whales you can see.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out the best time of the year to go.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose an original name for your company.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a newspaper advertisement for the company. Describe the experience of whale watching.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make suggestions.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I summarize basic information about whale watching in English.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a newspaper advertisement on whale watching.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make suggestions to a tourist for their whale watching trip.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn4le12ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": " 10", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>:  How do you like Mexico?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tourist</span>: We love it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I find Baja California is one of the most interesting areas in the world.<br/>"}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "7500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tourist</span>: What exactly do you mean by that?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Well, there's so much variety. It has everything, from deserts to mountains to forests to beaches.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tourist</span>: Yes, you're right about that."}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "19300", "id": 3,